    {
      "text": "A PRISMA flow diagram for the systematic review: 100 studies imported for screening, 21 duplicates removed; 79 studies screened, 68 irrelevant; 11 full-text studies assessed for eligibility, 1 excluded for wrong intervention; 0 studies ongoing and 0 awaiting classification; 10 studies included.",
